{
  "script_id": "conical-spiral",
  "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
  "voice_key": "yunxi",
  "files": [
    {
      "script_id": "conical-spiral",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-1",
      "filename": "intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/conical-spiral/intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.41,
      "size": 54576,
      "text": "平面上的对数螺线你可能见过：半径按指数增长，越往外圈距越大。鹦鹉螺的壳就近似是它。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "conical-spiral",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-2",
      "filename": "intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/conical-spiral/intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.34,
      "size": 37440,
      "text": "现在做一件事：把这条平面螺线抬起来，让它贴在一个圆锥的表面上。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "conical-spiral",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-3",
      "filename": "intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/conical-spiral/intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.6,
      "size": 57600,
      "text": "抬法很简单，让高度与半径成正比，比例由圆锥的半顶角决定。得到的曲线就是圆锥螺线。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "conical-spiral",
      "section_id": "cone",
      "line_id": "cn-1",
      "filename": "cone-cn-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/conical-spiral/cone-cn-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.38,
      "size": 54144,
      "text": "怎么保证它真在圆锥上？圆锥面的方程是横纵坐标平方和等于竖坐标乘半顶角正切的平方。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "conical-spiral",
      "section_id": "cone",
      "line_id": "cn-2",
      "filename": "cone-cn-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/conical-spiral/cone-cn-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.37,
      "size": 53856,
      "text": "把参数化代进去，残差在十的负十四次方量级，可以认为精确为零。曲线确实贴在锥面上。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "conical-spiral",
      "section_id": "cone",
      "line_id": "cn-3",
      "filename": "cone-cn-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/conical-spiral/cone-cn-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.58,
      "size": 57312,
      "text": "顶点在原点。参数趋于负无穷时半径按指数趋于零，所以曲线无限逼近顶点但永不到达。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "conical-spiral",
      "section_id": "projection",
      "line_id": "pj-1",
      "filename": "projection-pj-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/conical-spiral/projection-pj-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.31,
      "size": 37008,
      "text": "既然是把对数螺线抬起来得到的，那压回去应该还是对数螺线。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "conical-spiral",
      "section_id": "projection",
      "line_id": "pj-2",
      "filename": "projection-pj-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/conical-spiral/projection-pj-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.91,
      "size": 46512,
      "text": "验证很直接：算曲线上点到竖轴的距离，看它是不是等于初始半径乘 e 的 kt 次方。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "conical-spiral",
      "section_id": "projection",
      "line_id": "pj-3",
      "filename": "projection-pj-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/conical-spiral/projection-pj-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.57,
      "size": 57168,
      "text": "实测偏差在十的负十六次方量级。所以圆锥螺线的底面投影，确实精确地是那条对数螺线。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "conical-spiral",
      "section_id": "equiangular",
      "line_id": "eq-1",
      "filename": "equiangular-eq-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/conical-spiral/equiangular-eq-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.75,
      "size": 60048,
      "text": "对数螺线最著名的性质是等角：径向与切向的夹角处处相同。抬到圆锥上之后，有一个对应的性质。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "conical-spiral",
      "section_id": "equiangular",
      "line_id": "eq-2",
      "filename": "equiangular-eq-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/conical-spiral/equiangular-eq-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.02,
      "size": 48240,
      "text": "圆锥的母线是从顶点出发的直线。圆锥螺线与所有母线的夹角，也处处相同。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "conical-spiral",
      "section_id": "equiangular",
      "line_id": "eq-3",
      "filename": "equiangular-eq-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/conical-spiral/equiangular-eq-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.43,
      "size": 54864,
      "text": "实测四个不同参数处的夹角完全一致，误差到小数点后八位。所以它也叫圆锥等角螺线。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "conical-spiral",
      "section_id": "tune",
      "line_id": "tn-1",
      "filename": "tune-tn-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/conical-spiral/tune-tn-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.97,
      "size": 47520,
      "text": "请拖动半顶角滑块。角度小时圆锥又尖又高，同样的半径处高度更大。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "conical-spiral",
      "section_id": "tune",
      "line_id": "tn-2",
      "filename": "tune-tn-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/conical-spiral/tune-tn-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.79,
      "size": 44640,
      "text": "角度大时圆锥又扁又平，曲线接近躺在平面上，趋近于原本的对数螺线。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "conical-spiral",
      "section_id": "tune",
      "line_id": "tn-3",
      "filename": "tune-tn-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/conical-spiral/tune-tn-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.55,
      "size": 40752,
      "text": "注意与母线的夹角也随之变化，但对任一固定的锥，这个角始终是常数。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "conical-spiral",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-1",
      "filename": "summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/conical-spiral/summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.76,
      "size": 44208,
      "text": "第一，圆锥螺线是把对数螺线抬到圆锥面上得到的，高度与半径成正比。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "conical-spiral",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-2",
      "filename": "summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/conical-spiral/summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.47,
      "size": 39456,
      "text": "第二，它的底面投影精确地是对数螺线，偏差在机器精度量级。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "conical-spiral",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-3",
      "filename": "summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/conical-spiral/summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.07,
      "size": 49104,
      "text": "第三，它与所有母线的夹角恒定，故称圆锥等角螺线。感谢观看，我们下次再见。"
    }
  ],
